<title>BELGIUM: KREDIETBANK, BBL CUT INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</title>
<headline>KREDIETBANK, BBL CUT INVESTMENT CREDIT RATES.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Kredietbank </p>
<p>and Banque Bruxelles Lambert (BBL) said on Monday</p>
<p>they would raise base rates for Belgian franc investment credits</p>
<p>from Wednesday, following a drop in long-term interest rates and</p>
<p>a similar move by other banks.</p>
<p>    MATURITY		     NEW RATE     OLD RATE</p>
<p>    three-year revisable     5.45 pct     5.70 pct</p>
<p>    five-year revisable	6.30 pct     6.60 pct</p>
<p>    10-year revisable	  7.45 pct     7.75 pct</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
